Instill a part of your living curse into a weapon in your inventory, and toss it nearby. This nearly impervious sentry will attack all nearby enemies for [8, 10, 12, 14, 16 (TL1-5)] turns. When the curse ends, the weapon will drop to the ground.

Cursed Sentry attack speed (currently [60%, 86%, 107%, 124%, 140% (TL1-5)]) will improve with talent level.

When you first select a weapon, it will be remembered and used as long as it's in your inventory. Use Choose Cursed Sentry talent to alter your selection.

At talent level 3, you get the ability to afflict powerful mundane objects (greater egos).

At talent level 5, you can corrupt artifacts.
